      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Gato Arranhador. Acostumado ao luxo por ter vivido com a realeza de Alola, Meowth de Alola se tornou muito exigente com sua alimentação. Extremamente orgulhoso e inteligente, luta de forma astuta e ataca incansavelmente os pontos fracos de seus inimigos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Meowth de Alola pode evoluir para Persian de Alola no nível 6 ou superior quando sua Lealdade for +2 ou maior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Fake Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Pay Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Captivate, Feint, Night Slash, Play Rough</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Dark Pulse</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Agility, Amnesia, Assurance, Attract, Body Slam, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Embargo, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Foul Play, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Lash Out, Last Resort, Metal Claw, Nasty Plot, Pay Day, Payback, Play Rough, Power Gem, Protect, Psych Up, Quash, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Round, Screech, Seed Bomb, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Uproar, Water Pulse, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Assist, Charm, Covet, Flail, Flatter, Foul Play, Hypnosis, Parting Shot, Punishment, Snatch, Spite</p>",
